NOTE ON SCOPE AND INTENDED USE

This license covers the source code in this repository. It does NOT grant any
rights to: (a) trained model artifacts (e.g. `*.pt`, scalers, calibrators),
which are not distributed here; or (b) third-party data accessed at runtime
(ESPN, FotMob, FBref, Understat, ClubElo, and others), which remain subject to
their respective providers' terms.

Pitchverse is an educational and research project. Its predictions are provided
for visualisation and study only, are not betting advice, and must not be used
for betting or any other financial decision.
